  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed large HMO, accommodating up to 8 occupants, would significantly intensify activity compared to a single-family dwelling. The associated comings and goings of occupants, visitors, and vehicles would result in increased noise and disturbance, harming the established residential character of this area. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy CP5 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010) and Policies DMD5 and DMD8 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014).\r",
    "The development, by virtue of its scale and intensity of occupation, would result in unacceptable levels of noise and general disturbance, harming the amenities of neighbouring residential occupiers. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy DMD 8 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014) and Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024)."
  ],
